        </h2>
        <p>
          Personalized learning is a key strength of modern E-Learning. It allows each learner to progress at their own pace, following study paths that match their interests, goals, and learning style.
          Through data analytics, artificial intelligence, and adaptive platforms, personalized E-Learning systems can identify a student’s strengths and weaknesses, recommend suitable resources, and adjust the difficulty of lessons automatically.
        </p>
